---
/**
 * AffiliateDisclosure.astro - the one-line commission disclosure. Used once
 * per page wherever affiliate links appear (Things to have on hand, Where to
 * buy), so callers never need to write the copy themselves.
 */
---

<p class="affiliate-disclosure">Some links pay us a small commission.</p>

<style>
  .affiliate-disclosure {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
</style>
